{"id":"en_the-mafia-king-claimed-me","title":"The Mafia King Claimed Me","titleEn":"The Mafia King Claimed Me","description":"Claire Hale is a florist whose brother was killed in mob violence, and she has no interest in anything connected to the mafia. Her resolve is tested on a rainy night when a wounded stranger bursts into her flower shop. After she saves his life, Claire learns his identity: Roman Moretti, the mafia king feared throughout the city. From that point on, she is drawn into the orbit of his dangerous fixation and his resolve to claim her as his own, even though she is engaged to another man.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-mafia-king-claimed-me/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-mafia-king-claimed-me/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mafia","Romance","Flash Marriage","Enemies to Lovers","Marriage Before Love","Toxic Relationship"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsno4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-mafia-king-claimed-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsno4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-king-claimed-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsno4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-king-claimed-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsno4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-king-claimed-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7